The  driver  handles  an HCCS IDE interface plugged into an Acorn
expansion slot.  It uses the standard IDE controller driver,  and
hence  can  use the standard driver.  The card provides three IDE
channels.  The internal 44‐way IDE connector is  channel  0,  the
internal 40‐way connector is channel 1 and the external connector
is  channel 2.  The driver was derived by reverse‐engineering the
card, so it may not handle the card entirely optimally.
